      "punte": [
        "fix: [taal] in 'wat hy sê hy gedoen en gesien het': 'wat hy se hy gedoen ... het' copies English 'what he says he did'.",
        "fix: [taal] in 'wat mense by koeie kon kry': The glossary entry mixes 'is' with 'kon', which can read as only historical.",
        "fix: [taal] in ''n entstof kry teen 'n siekte': 'kry teen 'n siekte' reads slightly awkwardly where 'n entstof teen 'n siekte kry' is the usual order.",
        "check (the language finder raised this; it may not be a fault): 'Hy het stof uit 'n sweer van koeipokke op 'n melkmeisie se hand geneem': 'stof' can read as 'dust' to a Grade 6 learner; a more precise word (such as the fluid or matter from the sore) would be clearer, but choosing it touches the content, so it is left to the writer.",
        "check (the language finder raised this; it may not be a fault): 'Pokke was 'n gevaarlike siekte wat merke op die vel gelaat het.': The study text says survivors 'dikwels' had marks, while the glossary entry, read alone, states it without a qualifier; not changed because adding a qualifier would change what the entry claims."
      ]
